@rfdrew If you would like to, you should definitely make a PR to talk about your tool inside of the documentation for homarr, I'm sure a lot of people might be interested by what you are building, it would give you more visibility. What do you think ? 

I figured it's pretty claude-heavy. If you have some spare usage credits / usage limits feel free to send a PR to homarr directly in order to improve on our existing APIs and I will review it. 

(Do not make both changes inside of the same PR)
